<div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
  <nav class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-6">
    <%= link_to "Home", root_path, class: "hover:text-blue-600" %> /
    <span class="text-slate-600">Privacy Policy</span>
  </nav>

  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 text-slate-700">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>Last updated: <%= Time.now.year %></p>

    <p class="mt-4">We respect your privacy. We collect only the minimum information necessary to provide and improve the service — for example, email addresses when you submit feedback or create an account. We do not sell personal data. For details on what we collect and how it's used, please contact us at <%= mail_to ENV.fetch("ADMIN_EMAIL", "support@howlongagogo.com") %>.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6">Cookies and tracking</h2>
    <p>We use cookies and analytics to understand usage and improve the site. You can opt out of some tracking via your browser settings.</p>

    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6">Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain personal data only as long as necessary to provide the service or as required by law.</p>

    <div class="mt-8">
      <%= link_to "Back to support", contact_path, class: "inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-700" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
